# An allowlist: nothing goes into the build unless it is named here. That keeps .env, data/ (your
# projects and uploads), .git and local tooling folders out of the image.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src
!web
!motion

# Inside those folders: no installs, build output or caches (the image builds its own)
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.hyperframes
web/dist
